"[color=#E9DFC1]Reduces [color=#FFD16D]all[/color] damage taken by the percent (%) difference of [color=#FFD16D]Current Ward / Maximum Ward[/color] ([color=#26D345]{0:P2}[/color]).[/color]\n"
